{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45591","headline":"陈宫词 · 贯休","name":"陈宫词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缅想当时宫阙盛，荒宴椒房懱尧圣。\n玉树花歌百花里，珊瑚窗中海日迸。\n大臣来朝酒未醒，酒醒忠谏多不听。\n陈宫因此成野田，耕人犂破宫人镜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}